flowchart TD
  Start((Start)) --> Browse[Browse or search published catalog]
  Browse --> Detail[View product and choose available options]
  Detail --> Cart[Add to browser-persisted cart]
  Cart --> Signed{Signed in?}
  Signed -- No --> SignIn[Clerk sign-in]
  SignIn --> Checkout[Submit checkout]
  Signed -- Yes --> Checkout
  Checkout --> Fetch[Fetch current Sanity product data]
  Fetch --> Valid{Price, stock, quantity and options valid?}
  Valid -- No --> Fix[Show validation error; update cart]
  Fix --> Cart
  Valid -- Yes --> Session[Create Stripe Checkout Session]
  Session --> Created{Session created?}
  Created -- No --> Retry[Show error; allow checkout retry]
  Retry --> Checkout
  Created -- Yes --> Next((Continue to Part 2))
